<title>JAPAN: BOJ says sees Oct-Dec M2+CD growing 3-4 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>BOJ says sees Oct-Dec M2+CD growing 3-4 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Japan said on Friday it expects Japan's broadly defined money supply average of M2 plus certificates of deposit (CDs) for the October-December period to grow between three and four percent from the same quarter last year.</p>
<p>M2+CDs grew 3.6 percent in the July-September quarter from a year earlier.</p>
</text>
